      "file": "pages/order-status.html",
      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex\">\n    <title>Order Status — Custom T-Shirts | Northwest Custom Apparel</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.png\" type=\"image/png\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,500;12..96,700;12..96,800&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <!-- Absolute /pages/... paths — this page serves at the clean URL /order-status,\n         where relative paths would break. -->\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/shared_components/css/tokens.css?v=2026.09.08.2\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/pages/css/custom-tees.css?v=2026.09.07.20\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/pages/css/order-status.css?v=2026.09.07.14\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"status-body\">\n    <header class=\"site-head\">\n        <div class=\"site-head-inner\">\n            <a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\">\n                <img src=\"https://cdn.caspio.com/A0E15000/Safety%20Stripes/web%20northwest%20custom%20apparel%20logo.png?ver=1\" alt=\"Northwest Custom Apparel\" class=\"brand-logo\">\n                <span class=\"brand-text\">\n                    <strong>Northwest Custom Apparel</strong>\n                    <em>Custom T-Shirts · Full-Color DTG</em>\n                </span>\n            </a>\n            <div class=\"head-contact\">\n                <a href=\"tel:253-922-5793\"><i class=\"fas fa-phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> 253-922-5793</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main class=\"status-main\">\n        <!-- Loading state -->\n        <section id=\"st-loading\" class=\"status-card\">\n            <div class=\"status-spin\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-notch fa-spin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div>\n            <h1>Looking up your order…</h1>\n            <p>One moment while we fetch the latest status.</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Order state -->\n        <section id=\"st-order\" class=\"status-card\" hidden>\n            <p class=\"status-kicker\">Order status</p>\n            <h1>Order <span id=\"st-order-num\">—</span></h1>\n            <p class=\"status-style\" id=\"st-style\"></p>\n            <p class=\"status-promise\" id=\"st-promise\" hidden></p>\n\n            <div class=\"status-tracking\" id=\"st-tracking\" hidden></div>\n\n            <div class=\"status-timeline\" id=\"st-timeline\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"status-pickup\" id=\"st-pickup\" hidden>\n                <i class=\"fas fa-store\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n                <div>\n                    <strong>Pickup — Northwest Custom Apparel</strong>\n                    <span>2025 Freeman Rd E, Milton, WA 98354<br>We’ll call you the moment your order is ready.</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"status-mockups\" id=\"st-mockups\"></div>\n\n            <h2 class=\"status-h2\">Order summary</h2>\n            <div class=\"status-table-wrap\">\n                <table class=\"status-table\">\n                    <thead><tr><th>Color</th><th>Size</th><th>Qty</th><th>Each</th></tr></thead>\n                    <tbody id=\"st-items\"></tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"status-summary\" id=\"st-summary\"></div>\n\n            <p class=\"status-questions\" id=\"st-questions\"></p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Not found / error state -->\n        <section id=\"st-error\" class=\"status-card\" hidden>\n            <div class=\"status-check is-amber\"><i class=\"fas fa-triangle-exclamation\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div>\n            <h1>We couldn’t find that order</h1>\n            <p id=\"st-error-msg\">The link may be incomplete — try opening it again from your confirmation email. Or call us and we’ll look it up for you.</p>\n            <p class=\"status-phone\"><a href=\"tel:253-922-5793\"><i class=\"fas fa-phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> 253-922-5793</a></p>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer class=\"site-foot\">\n        <p>© Northwest Custom Apparel · 2025 Freeman Rd E, Milton, WA 98354 · <a href=\"tel:253-922-5793\">253-922-5793</a> · <a href=\"mailto:sales@nwcustomapparel.com\">sales@nwcustomapparel.com</a></p>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script src=\"/pages/js/order-status.js?v=2026.09.06.1\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "title": "Order Status — Custom T-Shirts | Northwest Custom Apparel",
      "bodyText": "Northwest Custom Apparel Custom T-Shirts · Full-Color DTG 253-922-5793 Looking up your order… One moment while we fetch the latest status. Order status Order — Pickup — Northwest Custom Apparel 2025 Freeman Rd E, Milton, WA 98354We’ll call you the moment your order is ready. Order summary ColorSizeQtyEach We couldn’t find that order The link may be incomplete — try opening it again from your confirmation email. Or call us and we’ll look it up for you. 253-922-5793 © Northwest Custom Apparel · 2025 Freeman Rd E, Milton, WA 98354 · 253-922-5793 · sales@nwcustomapparel.com",
